            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Deploy to Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You are about to create the following products in &lt;strong&gt;{!$Organization.Name}&lt;/strong&gt;, with their Standard and ChyronHego pricebook entries and CPQ costs:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;{!ListText}&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Part Codes that already have a Product are skipped. Click &lt;strong&gt;Deploy&lt;/strong&gt; to continue.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
        </fields>
        <nextOrFinishButtonLabel>Deploy</nextOrFinishButtonLabel>
